[{"title":"之仪家当涂七年矣屡过禅岳山下望高山塔欲一游辄不果异时山主勤公大师与其子宣上人相过因往报之取路回远薄晚方到遂留宿栋宇一新舍次皆得其便而宏丽高朗唯见者知焉又复规范齐肃钟鼓应接问之乃勤一力所就丝蓄粒聚未尝毫发资之人此尤难者感叹不已因赋二小诗 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"窣堵频经眼，伽蓝未息肩。\n多情两父子，同住一云烟。\n缭绕寻幽径，从容慰昔年。\n本无留客意，投分且迁延。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"之仪家当涂七年矣屡过禅岳山下望高山塔欲一游辄不果异时山主勤公大师与其子宣上人相过因往报之取路回远薄晚方到遂留宿栋宇一新舍次皆得其便而宏丽高朗唯见者知焉又复规范齐肃钟鼓应接问之乃勤一力所就丝蓄粒聚未尝毫发资之人此尤难者感叹不已因赋二小诗 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"去往如流水，兴衰似转肩。\n新工几夺目，旧爨仅留烟。\n愿起三千劫，功收十八年。\n儿孙尽龙象，家世自绵延。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏云山居 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"鸟语晚更好，山风秋转凉。\n心閒日自永，簟冷梦尤长。\n赤荐新舂稻，清添旧荫香。\n此身归有地，去路尚何妨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏云山居 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"雨后山尤好，秋来方此时。\n心清觉老健，步懒欲归迟。\n林响惊鼷鼠，风閒叫画眉。\n善人吾岂敢，去此尚何之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居夏日","author":"李之仪","text":"金锁笼窗日，黄缯蔽柳蝉。\n恋莺忘日转，借榻就凉偏。\n好作宿山计，难堪被俗牵。\n归途迎晚照，豫促渡头船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诚上人游方既归林下焚香诵经以严报地相见欣然留不欲去遂赋小诗","author":"李之仪","text":"委曲披高下，虚明得静深。\n佛香平日愿，经卷本来心。\n地据三车上，尘无一点侵。\n出山应有恨，何处似如今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿青山坊君锡馆置甚款时方兴圩","author":"李之仪","text":"命驾追彭泽，开怀得士龙。\n残寒偏恼客，小雨未妨农。\n已幸同归辙，何劳更赁舂。\n川原如故里，疑是旧栽松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将过黄池中路寒甚风猛不可行复归青山坊投宿","author":"李之仪","text":"过午风虽恶，此心难自安。\n如何一时顷，遂变十分寒。\n忍听僵夫诉，还思昨夜欢。\n祇应贤地主，犹作故侯看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵俞希贤大暑家居寄天宁二老","author":"李之仪","text":"静退陶彭泽，风流支道林。\n论欢虽暂阻，投分本来深。\n客舍汗如洗，僧轩云正阴。\n莫因俗眼碍，终负胜游心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答友人二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"比日逢春社，占龙得贲山。\n虽能素愿合，未放老身閒。\n家世绵延远，功名指顾间。\n自应天有助，一到一开颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答友人二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"春来自多雨，行处只逢山。\n赋分皆可乐，贪生常不閒。\n人归挑菜处，鸟语落梅间。\n翻恨新增酒，何从解醉颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食笋二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"燕雀初为友，烽烟近卜邻。\n不嫌千语聒，只怕一笼新。\n病眼常如睡，归心喜似人。\n柈餐犹见笋，未省已无春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食笋二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"疏帘不碍日，缺甃宛如塘。\n默坐千名佛，忘形一炷香。\n卷中贪味永，镜里任颜苍。\n饮后才推枕，逡巡又夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢陈无己相访","author":"李之仪","text":"下直来天禄，柴荆故远求。\n论心日恨短，归路雨无忧。\n红叶缤纷晚，黄花烂缦秋。\n会须寻此况，击节再相酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53203,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昨日偶到北观蒙君俞元载元发明叔惠然见过","author":"李之仪","text":"胜日欣相得，旷怀谁与同。\n如何四君子，肯顾一衰翁。\n林杪收残雨，檐牙递好风。\n归时不须问，更待月如弓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53204,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回酒","author":"李之仪","text":"莫笑和州酒，和州酒却醇。\n聊资千岁祝，用赞一阳春。\n柳信涡将报，梨晴点向真。\n醉寻平日路，好在武陵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53205,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书长干僧房","author":"李之仪","text":"异日延禅地，今朝选佛场。\n真身瘗坚固，层级韵琅当。\n雨洒家家润，灯传处处光。\n曾将一则语，要路截诸方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53206,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题三首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"邂逅俱青眼，招携愧白头。\n穿林犹畏日，坐石忽惊秋。\n不作崎岖倦，几成汗漫游。\n临分怀杜老，月涌大江流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53207,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题三首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"步武高低外，生涯梦寐中。\n不知三径足，信是一生穷。\n触目如逢旧，随缘似有功。\n便应参羽翼，何异注鱼虫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53208,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题三首 其三","author":"李之仪","text":"轩庑千寻碧，江山一抹红。\n微吟接僚友，健啖趁群童。\n恋别犹能暂，论欢昔已通。\n更凭将此况，远问霅溪翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53209,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题历阳天庆观自然庵","author":"李之仪","text":"一日复一日，新年即旧年。\n本来无欠少，强自起攀缘。\n妙悟通三境，清风寄七弦。\n升腾如未果，且作地行仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53210,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自大乘将游汤泉道中","author":"李之仪","text":"迢迢山路永，漠漠晓风昏。\n雨歇鸠呼妇，年丰稻有孙。\n旅怀悲暮齿，野饭寄前村。\n只恐今宵梦，凭谁续断魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53211,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中过明觉招上人辄留小诗","author":"李之仪","text":"雨路如投洗，山行似踏绳。\n深閒逢竹院，欢喜得诗僧。\n语款疑缫茧，心明自有灯。\n难忘惜别处，高义等丘陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53212,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿滴水岩怀赵德麟和壁间韵","author":"李之仪","text":"瀑水泻灵窦，铿锵韶濩音。\n树深猿啸月，山迥鸟归林。\n一曲广陵散，再歌梁甫吟。\n天边有鸿雁，莫寄此时心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53213,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜行巩洛道上","author":"李之仪","text":"夜久露华重，寒鸦不肯栖。\n月推银海上，斗过玉绳西。\n风脱林衣瘦，山擎云帽低。\n流萤三四点，趁队过前溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53214,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李钦之承事宅","author":"李之仪","text":"松竹庞公宅，丘坟倚相家。\n和声敦雁序，秀色茂兰芽。\n鲁秉方如昔，淮流讵可涯。\n踌躇不欲去，寒日任西斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53215,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离宣城","author":"李之仪","text":"倦客登舟际，江城欲暮时。\n恨长山自远，心速棹归迟。\n村市明鱼火，严城起鼓鼙。\n诗成真有助，新月上天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53216,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日游青山访太白墓二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"潦倒忘衰日，风流袭垫巾。\n未能分朽骨，还此挹馀尘。\n吊古无千载，伤心为一颦。\n依稀如到眼，气类信吾人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53217,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日游青山访太白墓二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"淹时苦炎暑，此日遇初秋。\n旧籍存千亩，彝伦咏九畴。\n但能寻旷荡，何必事深幽。\n未愧辽东笑，真成知北游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53218,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游青山因过西庄","author":"李之仪","text":"青山忽相值，一笑脱征衫。\n未就三都赋，聊寻五柳潜。\n并游虽得意，作阔更愁兼。\n问字终忘倦，言归但小惭。\n旁求须作相，未聘且耕岩。\n赠别无多语，禔身要律贪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53219,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同荣天和游石城","author":"李之仪","text":"兹游久寂寞，胜士偶陪随。\n竹暗笋初熟，江深鲈正肥。\n但须频结社，何必访题诗。\n会有重来日，还应记此时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53220,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢人送鱼","author":"李之仪","text":"珍重黄池秀，风流迥出尘。\n多情念羁旅，脱网寄鲜鳞。\n掀动龙蛟宅，惊回匕箸春。\n丹青如得便，更拟问通津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53221,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题齐云亭","author":"李之仪","text":"凌空登白纻，此地与云齐。\n一览众山小，方知人世低。\n暂留蝴蝶梦，终负杜鹃啼。\n回向禅关客，何当别有梯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53222,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺时相生辰","author":"李之仪","text":"锡羡来经世，储休表降神。\n云间瞻鸑鷟，天上识麒麟。\n蕴藉三冬学，形容万古春。\n班庭倾玉笋，镇庙契金人。\n帝载熙明格，朝签绝拟伦。\n渊源参密幄，同德在斯民。\n有作皆前用，无言不绪陈。\n光华荣斝寿，蕃锡会昌辰。\n宠接张侯异，年颁卫武均。\n江干空引睇，无路袭馀尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53223,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登山未还范景仁以诗见促次韵二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"扑面烟霞晓更嘉，偶随藜杖访仙家。\n斜阳不见登山屐，独绕长溪折夜花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53224,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登山未还范景仁以诗见促次韵二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"危墙烟际耸层城，潮落沙头眼更明。\n不觉归舟犯牛斗，天风吹下步虚声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53225,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵景仁海次西还二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"留滞初春寂寞滨，眼明归路一番新。\n何妨更作重来计，枝上微红解恼人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53226,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵景仁海次西还二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"二月春阴到水滨，秋风重见玉蟾新。\n无端扰扰来还去，只恐沙鸥解笑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53227,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵","author":"李之仪","text":"寻春何惜驻征鞍，只怕春归不怕寒。\n故国山川无限思，我来仍得雨中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53228,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柏台自述四首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"穷日愔愔已死灰，似沈眢井念昭回。\n一声霹雳起平地，顿觉青天万里开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53229,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柏台自述四首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"钻龟打瓦不曾休，金注昏人岂自由。\n谁谓纯诚无感格，会逢公议报私雠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53230,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柏台自述四首 其三","author":"李之仪","text":"一梦扬州似隔生，轻舟未往但贪程。\n莫年觳觫儿童念，风物依稀愧此情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53231,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柏台自述四首 其四","author":"李之仪","text":"熬熬内火战骄阳，鹤唳风声便着忙。\n波浪翻天谁与渡，却应甘井是慈航。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53232,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江西庄上久雨","author":"李之仪","text":"去秋欲雨不得雨，今春望晴还未晴。\n蝼蚁尚知为自便，强将私意与天争。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53233,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"路西庄绝句","author":"李之仪","text":"麦未登场已插秧，更忧雨过水还伤。\n一生能着几量屐，白发萧萧祇管忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53234,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿采石","author":"李之仪","text":"江声隐隐风前恨，雁阵喧喧枕畔愁。\n更觉孤衾如泼水，始知今夜宿山头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53235,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄西庄梅道者","author":"李之仪","text":"因缘时节本相期，只恐蹉跎醉似泥。\n洗尽从前留意处，何忧金臂不提携。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53236,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"元宵灯火闹游人，偶向忙中得此身。\n净几明窗尘不到，弄黄先见一枝春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53237,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"通中玉冷梦偏长，花影笼阶月浸廊。\n挽断罗巾留不住，觉来犹有去时香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53238,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞竹即事三绝 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"芭蕉叶密柿阴浓，散发西窗到晚钟。\n霹雳一声三尺水，旱天方信有真龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53239,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞竹即事三绝 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"纤絺不挂汗如倾，一霎风来梦乍惊。\n自是人心有凉思，强将庭叶作秋声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53240,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞竹即事三绝 其三","author":"李之仪","text":"鸭脚初成绿未齐，芭蕉仍在柿阴西。\n推迁节物均如此，眼界何须苦自迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53241,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书扇","author":"李之仪","text":"会稽陈迹久荒芜，流落江城墨未枯。\n好向溪边示行客，问人能出百钱无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53242,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题郭熙画扇 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"蹇驴破帽耸鸢肩，石里长松欲到天。\n六月尘埃汗如洗，始知立意不徒然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题郭熙画扇 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"袅袅凉风八月初，试挥椽笔写江湖。\n还家预想迎门喜，争问今年得意无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53244,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画夫子扇","author":"李之仪","text":"烟梢云顶石藏根，溪压舆梁晓乍分。\n车盖定寻何处路，皇皇犹想为斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53245,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画扇 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"曾记终南雪里山，玉峰琼岫耸巑岏。\n风流转入丹青手，画作江城六月寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53246,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画扇 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"落笔无因似退之，每逢佳致却如痴。\n孤高全露秋来骨，无复山红涧碧时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53247,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庄上书事","author":"李之仪","text":"柱础犹蒸湿未休，悬知雨意未全收。\n只忧场上芽生稻，不厌田间水拍沟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53248,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访僧不值","author":"李之仪","text":"我来独爱南天竺，公去谁烹北苑茶。\n赖有清风犹好客，扫门杨柳影交加。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53249,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天宁众寮即事","author":"李之仪","text":"不看经也不参禅，时去时来又一年。\n秪愿阇黎终有信，大家留取草鞋钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53250,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿吉先之学古堂","author":"李之仪","text":"停骖假馆雪初晴，学古堂中气象新。\n多谢故人无弃我，一炉软火煖如春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53251,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书于子高宅","author":"李之仪","text":"儿童鸡犬语声喧，桑柘萦纡绿蔽川。\n斗觉门庭兰玉盛，更将箫鼓乐丰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53252,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书俞秀老诗卷后","author":"李之仪","text":"荆公宾客晚多奇，休叹穰侯见事迟。\n雨过半山初睡足，何如蚊力负山时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53253,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写裙带","author":"李之仪","text":"轻裙碎摺晓风微，弱柳腰肢稳称衣。\n更剪垂虹平窄地，双凫似恐见人飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53254,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采石二首 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"云山夹岸去层层，来往扁舟恨未能。\n更有寻常最佳处，无风一日到金陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53255,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采石二首 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"鸡笼山下是和州，隔岸闻呼见点头。\n不见东归夜郎客，锦袍谁共醉扁舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53256,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浴南寺园头求诗","author":"李之仪","text":"一重洗尽一重生，尘垢昏人不自醒。\n会得栽茄种瓜意，始知松竹本来青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53257,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"源上人研","author":"李之仪","text":"过岭传衣不传钵，何事眼里更着枻。\n欲识黄梅半夜心，踏着称锤硬似铁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53258,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访采石臻山主不遇 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"入门不见主人公，座具袈裟在眼中。\n更有山童会人意，略无一事许相同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53259,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访采石臻山主不遇 其二","author":"李之仪","text":"十年采石寄漂蓬，广济虽名寺亦空。\n将为新来有消息，依前山不结蓬笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53260,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵湖阴韦深道五小诗 其一","author":"李之仪","text":"髭须潇飒面嶙峋，怪我多非旧日人。\n百里挐舟谁复尔，却应情重故情亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53261,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]